<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Payment Failed — Order Cancelled</title>
    <style>
      @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap');
    </style>
  </head>
  <body style="margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#000000;font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;color:#FFFFFF;">
    <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="background-color:#000000;margin:0;padding:0;width:100%;">
      <tr>
        <td>
          <div style="max-width:100%;margin:0 auto;padding:40px 20px;">
            <!-- Logo -->
            <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin-bottom:40px;">
              <tr>
                <td align="center">
                  <img src="https://cardcades3prod.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/cardcade-machine-wordmark.png" alt="CardCade Logo" width="280" style="display:block;width:280px;height:auto;" />
                </td>
              </tr>
            </table>

            <!-- Heading -->
            <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin-bottom:30px;">
              <tr>
                <td align="center">
                  <h1 style="font-size:28px;font-weight:700;color:#ff4d4d;margin:0;font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;">❌ Payment Failed — Order Cancelled</h1>
                  <p style="font-size:16px;color:#FFFFFF;opacity:0.7;margin-top:8px;font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;">The ACH transfer did not clear</p>
                </td>
              </tr>
            </table>

            <!-- Main Box -->
            <div style="background-color:#181818;border-radius:16px;border:1px solid #2C2C2C;padding:40px;max-width:700px;width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;margin:0 auto;">
              <div style="max-width:700px;margin:0 auto;color:#FFFFFF;">
                <p style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:10px;opacity:0.7;font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;text-transform:capitalize;color:#FFFFFF;">
                  Hi <%= params.sellerName %>,
                </p>

                <div style="background-color:#3a0000;border:2px solid #ff4d4d;border-radius:12px;padding:20px 24px;margin:20px 0;">
                  <p style="margin:0 0 10px 0;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#ff4d4d;font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;">⚠️ Do Not Ship</p>
                  <p style="margin:0;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#FFFFFF;font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;">
                    The buyer's ACH payment for <b><%= params.itemName %></b> has <b>failed to settle</b>. The order has been <b>cancelled automatically</b> and the item has been returned to your available stock.
                  </p>
                </div>

                <!-- Order Details -->
                <div style="background-color:#222222;border-left:4px solid #ff4d4d;padding:16px 20px;margin:0 0 28px 0;border-radius:8px;">
                  <p style="margin:8px 0;font-size:16px;font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;color:#FFFFFF;"><span style="font-weight:600;color:#FFFFFF;">Item:</span> <span style="opacity:0.8;"><%= params.itemName %></span></p>
                  <p style="margin:8px 0;font-size:16px;font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;color:#FFFFFF;"><span style="font-weight:600;color:#FFFFFF;">Buyer:</span> <span style="opacity:0.8;"><%= params.buyerName %></span></p>
                  <p style="margin:8px 0;font-size:16px;font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;color:#FFFFFF;"><span style="font-weight:600;color:#FFFFFF;">Cancelled Order ID:</span> <span style="opacity:0.8;"><%= params.orderId %></span></p>
                </div>

                <p style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:24px;opacity:0.7;font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;color:#FFFFFF;">
                  No action is required from you. If you had already prepared the item, you can return it to inventory. If you have any questions, please contact support.
                </p>

                <p style="margin-top:24px;font-size:18px;line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:30px;opacity:0.7;font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;color:#FFFFFF;">
                  Cheers,<br /><b style="font-size:20px;">The CardCade Team</b>
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Footer -->
            <div style="margin-top:60px;font-size:14px;text-align:center;color:#FFFFFF;font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;">
              © CardCade 2026
            </div>
          </div>
        </td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </body>
</html>
